      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Priced at 2x the global market rate and capped daily by level so buying stays an emergency fallback and the normal loop remains factory production. The cap is summed across all material types to prevent diversification bypass."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_design_04_economy_inflation_control",
      "label": "Four-Axis Inflation Control",
