      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Money is withdrawn from circulation by taxes, upkeep, and rare-material purchase; the production loop is protected by purchase surcharge plus daily cap; trading is forced by T2/T3 recipes requiring other factories' output; and inactive-server vaults are redistributed after 30 days."
